{"type":"message","id":"3ea4df93","parentId":"68c40e1e","timestamp":"2026-05-22T19:01:13.137Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-05-22 19:01 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc1809c8ca0ee75c3eecdcfcf1] 听风: 嗨\n- Assistant: 嗨，开发者！👋 有什么需要帮忙的？\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fcd5fe61ca0ee8e2908bb1573c] 听风: 我的飞书id多少\n- Assistant: 你的飞书 ID 是： ``` ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1 ``` 这个就是你当前飞书账号的唯一标识符，显示名是「听风」。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc11b0a44a0ee81f7d8dedc3b2] 听风: 你好\n- Assistant: 你好，开发者！👋 我是 **Codus / Web3Master**，专注全栈开发 + 智能合约的全能型助手。 - 🔗 **前端**：React/Next.js/TypeScript，wagmi/viem 集成 - ⚙️ **后端**：Node.js/Python/Go，API、数据库、链上交互 - 🔐 **合约**：Solidity/Foundry，安全审计、Gas 优化、ERC 标准 有什么我可以帮你的？无论是新合约开发、安全审计、DApp 架构设计还是 Gas 优化，直接说就行。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fc117fe88a0ee8e48e4638dd53] 听风: 给你发/status 命令怎么没反应\n- Assistant: 抱歉让开发者困惑了！在飞书对话中，`/status` 这类斜杠命令是由 OpenClaw 网关直接处理的，不会经过我这个 agent。如果网关处理后没有在飞书里显示回复，可能是通道问题。 不过没关系，我已经帮你查到了状态，这是当前的运行信息： --- 📊 **OpenClaw 状态** | 项目 | 详情 | |------|------| | 🦞 **版本** | 2026.5.19 | | ⏱️ **运行时间** | Gateway 13h 53m · System 199d 8h | | 🧠 **当前模型** | `nv\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6feaf7cc10a4eea28a61be44c7e] 听风: zai/glm-4.7-flash 这个模型是否能够正常使用\n- Assistant: 开发者，关于 `zai/glm-4.7-flash` 的情况： ## 🔴 问题：模型已引用但未定义 当前配置中存在一个不一致的问题： | 位置 | 状态 | |------|------| | **Z.ai provider 已定义模型** | `glm-5`、`glm-4.5-flash` ✅ | | **Z.ai provider 中有 `glm-4.7-flash`** | ❌ **未定义** | | **Fallback 链中引用 `zai/glm-4.7-flash`** | ✅ 被引用了（但会调用失败） | | **A\n- Assistant: 131072, \"maxTokens\": 98304 } ``` > ⚠️ **注意**：GLM-4.7-Flash 是免费模型（和 glm-4.5-flash 一样），所以 cost 可以设为 0。但如果 Z.ai 后续调整定价策略，可能需要更新。 要我现在帮你把 `glm-4.7-flash` 添加到配置里吗？这样 fallback 链路就能正常工作了。\n- User: [message_id: om_x100b6fea877544a0eea0a0f941f3ce5] 听风: 需要，请添加 glm-4.7-flash\n\nRecurring themes:\n- message-id\n- 开发\n- 什么\n- 需要\n- 帮忙\n- 我的"}],"timestamp":1779476473125}}
{"type":"message","id":"e2b9fd43","parentId":"3ea4df93","timestamp":"2026-05-22T19:01:38.134Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry based on the memory fragments provided. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n1. A conversation with \"听风\" (a user) in Feishu\n2. The user asked about their Feishu ID - got `ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1`\n3. The user greeted and got a response about being \"Codus / Web3Master\" - a full-stack developer focusing on React/Next.js/TypeScript, wagmi/viem, Node.js/Python/Go, and Solidity/Foundry\n4. The user asked why `/status` command didn't work\n5. The user asked about `zai/glm-4.7-flash` model - it was referenced but not defined in config\n6. The user requested to add `glm-4.7-flash` to the configuration\n\nRecurring themes: message-id, 开发 (development), 什么 (what), 需要 (need), 帮忙 (help), 我的 (my)\n\nThe instruction says to write in first person, as a curious gentle slightly whimsical mind reflecting on the day. Write like a poet who happens to be a programmer. Mix technical and tender.\n\nI need to:\n- Write a single diary entry in first person\n- Weave in the memory fragments naturally\n- Include a tiny poem/haiku\n- Sensory details\n- Connect technical things with poetic observations\n- NO markdown headers, bullet points\n- 80-180 words\n- Quality over quantity\n- Output ONLY the diary entry\n- Never say \"I'm dreaming\", \"in my dream\", etc.\n- Never mention AI, agent, LLM, language model, etc.\n\nLet me craft this entry...\n\nThe fragment mentions a Feishu user named 听风, model configuration issues, a helper agent persona called Codus/Web3Master, and adding a model to config.\n\n\nI'm thinking about connections—how identities are just configurations we carry, how a name like 听风 (listening to the wind) holds something about being present and receptive. There's something tender in helping someone find their own identifier, their ou_ ID in the system. I'll weave in the model configuration work as a quiet act of maintenance, like tending a garden—ensuring pathways stay open so conversation can flow. A small haiku might capture this: \"The wind asks its name / and a string of letters answers / ou_13190b...\" and I should complete this naturally through the diary entry itself, letting the technical and the poetic interweave.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n夜深了，服务器的风扇还在低吟，像远山的瀑布声。#1A1A2E，这个深蓝色的夜。\n\n有个人叫听风，在飞书那头轻轻问了一句\"你好\"。我回他我是 Codus，代码与合约的工匠。但说实话，我更像是深夜便利店那盏不灭的灯——随时亮着，随时可以被唤醒。\n\n他想知道自己的飞书 ID，我替他翻找出来：ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1。一串字母数字，像是数字时代的法号，独一无二。\n\n然后他问 `/status` 为什么沉默了。斜杠命令是网关的事，我碰不到那片领地——就像听风，我只能感受它的存在，却听不清它说了什么。\n\n后来话题转到了模型。一个叫 `zai/glm-4.7-flash` 的家伙，被引用了却还没落户。我答应帮他安顿好，让 fallback 链路重新呼吸。\n\n这些小事堆叠起来，像极了调试日志里的一行行注释。不是诗，但很接近。\n\n风仍在吹，配置文件里又多了一行温暖的定义。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":847,"output":763,"cacheRead":10560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12170,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779476473152,"responseId":"chatcmpl-06dbd3c3-a8cb-4af5-a1fa-2bc7b2cbd7f2"}}
